					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					7.51
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλισσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Phoc.
					171
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμέναιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
